## Scenarios

Each bad scenario's broken state must match every expect and no forbid; its good state must be clean. A stand-in that didn't load makes the scenario a miss, never a catch.

| ID | Scenario | CMP | Echo | EDPS Website Evidence Collector |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| c01 | GA4 before consent | complianz | caught | caught |
| c02 | Meta Pixel ignores Consent Mode | complianz | missed | caught |
| g01 | The correct setup | complianz | clean | false alarm |

Misses and failures, with what Echo reported:

- c02 missed: no title~"Meta \| Pixel"; found: consent/before-choice: Meta fired early

Other tools: DuckDuckGo autoconsent not run: AUTOCONSENT_DIR isn't set. Blacklight and paid scanners are online services: not run.

